\end{equation*}
The tree $\mathcal{D}(\mathsf{R+NW})$ is ``skewed to the right.''
\textbf{Algorithm T} reaches the rightmost execution graph with probability $1/2^n$.
The expectation is $n+1$ but the variance is 
\[
\sum_{i=1}^{n}\frac{1}{2^i}2^{2i} + \frac{1}{2^n}2^{2n} = 2^{n+1} + 2^n - 2
\]
